---
title: Advisory
layout: layouts/base.njk
seoTitle: Advisory — Parul Soni Manvati
seoDescription: I work selectively with founders, CEOs, leadership teams and organisations navigating important transitions — from defining what needs to change to designing and building what comes next.
---
<section class="page-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>When the problem is bigger than a meeting.</h1>
    <p>I work selectively with founders, CEOs, leadership teams and organisations navigating important transitions — from defining what needs to change to designing and building what comes next.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    {% set services = advisory.items | selectattr("enabled") | sort(attribute="order") %}
    {% if services.length %}
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for service in services %}
      <article class="story-card">
        <h3>{{ service.title }}</h3>
        <p class="card-body">{{ service.description }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-state">No advisory services published yet. Add one via Admin → Advisory.</div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="teaser__ctas" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss an advisory need →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
